---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About Us" description="ScoutMakes is an open source electronics company dedicated to encouraging everyone to learn engineering.">
  <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
  <h1>About ScoutMakes</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    ScoutMakes is an open source electronics company dedicated to encouraging everyone, young and old, to learn
    engineering. The ScoutMakes STEM-education kits let you have fun while exploring the world of electronics.
  </p>
  <p>
    ScoutMakes is designed by <a href="https://github.com/tinkeringtech/scoutmakes">TinkeringTech</a>. Every kit
    is open source hardware, certified by the Open Source Hardware Association (OSHWA), with design files and
    firmware published on GitHub.
  </p>
</BaseLayout>
